      "version": "1.0.1",
      "description": "<p>Added config support. You can now set the multiplier used for bot health.\nThe default config uses a 1x multiplier and the behaviour will be the same as version 1.0.0</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Example 1</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Player Stomach = 70HP</li>\n<li>Boss Stomach = 200HP</li>\n<li>Multiplier = 2.0</li>\n<li>Boss Stomach after mod ajustments = 140HP (70 x 2)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Example 2</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Player Stomach = 70HP</li>\n<li>Boss Stomach = 200HP</li>\n<li>Multiplier = 0.5</li>\n<li>Boss Stomach after mod ajustments = 35HP (70 x 0.5)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Example 3</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Player Stomach = 70HP</li>\n<li>Random bot Stomach = 60HP</li>\n<li>Multiplier = 1.0</li>\n<li>Boss Stomach after mod ajustments = 60HP (unchanged because it is lower than Player Stomach * multiplier)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n",
      "link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2391/fair-bot-health/1.0.1",
